# @digitaplatform/* is published to GitHub Packages (private, digitaplatform org).
# This maps the scope to GitHub's npm registry. AUTH is deliberately NOT stored
# here: pnpm ignores an _authToken in a committed .npmrc (it could leak the secret
# to an attacker-controlled registry). Provide a token with read:packages
# OUT-OF-BAND (user-level, never committed):
#   pnpm config set '//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken' "$(gh auth token)"
@digitaplatform:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
